<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Heat Resistance</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 6), Conjurer (guild level 15)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast heat resistance &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast heat resistance</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's fire sphere for about ten minutes. Your ability in a 
sphere also protects you against its spells (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>), so the 
target resists fire spells better: burn, fireball, fire blast and the like. 
The better your protection sphere, the bigger the raise, up to ten points and 
a little more for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cold Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>